    "title": "Virginia Railway Express Launches #VREMakesCents Campaign - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago Provided by Virginia Railway Express (VRE) With August marking the final stretch of summer travel and the return of many commuters to the office, Virginia Railway Express (VRE) is encouraging area residents to save on transportation costs by leaving the driving behind, even as Virginia gas prices average 38% over 2025 costs. Through the #VREMakesCents campaign, the rail agency is spreading the word that traveling by VRE can save commuters and their families thousands of dollars per year — keeping more money in riders’ pockets and less spent on fuel, parking, and other driving-related expenses. Read full article",
